{"text": "They buried their son in a large cemetery about two miles away, and they came back to a house full of silence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Days passed slowly, and the old couple seemed to be waiting for something else to happen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About a week later, Missus White suddenly woke in the night and cried out, The paw, The monkeys paw. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said that they still had two wishes left, and she begged her husband to wish their son alive again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Mister White was afraid, because Herbert had been dead for ten days and had been badly hurt in the accident. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you saw him now, you would be even more frightened, he said, but his wife would not listen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He went down alone to the dark parlor, where the paw lay on the shelf above the fireplace. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Returning to the bedroom, the old man raised the paw and said, I wish my son alive again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The paw fell to the floor, and the candle soon went out, but nothing happened, so they went back to bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lying awake in the darkness, they listened to the clock ticking and the stairs creaking in the quiet house.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "b", "u", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "s", "o", "n", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", "e", " ", "c", "e", "m", "e", "t", "e", "r", "y", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "m", "i", "l", "e", "s", " ", "a", "w", "a", "y", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "s", "i", "l", "e", "n", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "a", "y", "s", " ", "p", "a", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "s", "l", "o